From: Redmi AX3000 NSS integration
Subject: [PATCH] ECM: safely exclude QoS-managed wireless interfaces

Bound and serialize the denied-interface sysctl, protect packet lookups,
publish policy before retiring only affected flows, and clean up on unload.
This keeps LAN acceleration while wireless WAN ingress traverses NSS SQM.

